== 1. half loops ==
free loop of a stitch whose other loop was never worked: REJECT  [as expected] :: 该半针没有被先前的挑针操作保留，不能凭空补出
free loop on the SAME side that was worked (BLO worked, ask back): REJECT  [as expected] :: 该半针没有被先前的挑针操作保留，不能凭空补出
two FreeLoops steps over the same front loops (both listed final): REJECT  [as expected] :: 最终工作边通过别名重复列出同一针位
two FreeLoops aliases, only one listed final: ACCEPT :: created=16 consumed=8 final={'two': 4, 'lip_a': 4}
   created: 16 | lip_a is lip_b: True | events for lip_b: []
work the same lips through both aliases: REJECT  [as expected] :: 针位已使用，不能通过其他别名再次使用：Site(edge='one', position=1, face='front_loop')
hold alias A then FreeLoops again: REJECT  [as expected] :: 针位已保留给 h，须通过该保留边继续
split a reserved lip again (BLO of a front_loop site): REJECT  [as expected] :: 半针或特殊落针位不能再次拆分为半针
FLO on a chain underside / row end: REJECT  [as expected] :: 半针或特殊落针位不能再次拆分为半针
