chain top worked FLO, BLO lip reserved, underside worked: ACCEPT :: created=24 consumed=12 final={'r1': 4, 'r2': 4, 'r3': 4}
== 3. row ends ==
row end of a route that is not flat (segment): REJECT  [as expected] :: 行侧挑针须引用已建立并明确方向的片钩行
row end of joined_rows: REJECT  [as expected] :: 行侧挑针须引用已建立并明确方向的片钩行
row end of a row not yet made: REJECT  [as expected] :: 行侧挑针须引用已建立并明确方向的片钩行
same row end twice inside one RowEdges: REJECT  [as expected] :: 同一路径重复引用针位
same row end under two step ids (alias), one listed final: ACCEPT :: created=9 consumed=4 final={'one': 4, 'side_a': 1}
   created: 9 | same site: True
same row end worked through both aliases: REJECT  [as expected] :: 针位已使用，不能通过其他别名再次使用：Site(edge='one', position=1, face='row_left')
row end taken at the end that is slip-stitched to the base (attached ribbing shape): ACCEPT :: created=16 consumed=8 final={'rib1': 3, 'pick': 1, 'rest': 4}
   row_end_site event: [((Site(edge='rib1', position=3, face='top'),), (Site(edge='rib1', position=1, face='row_right'),))]
row ends listed in zig-zag order across both sides: ACCEPT :: created=24 consumed=16 final={'three': 4, 'band': 4}
   markdown step text: 依序挑行端：one 的 left 行端；three 的 right 行端；two 的 left 行端；one 的 right 行端
