== 5. 'leave unworked' declarations ==
both faces of the same chain stitches retired as 'unused chain face' in mid-row: ACCEPT :: created=22 consumed=16 final={'r': 6}
   inventory: {'retired_without_work': 10, 'retirement_declarations': [{'step': 'gap_under', 'reason': 'unused_chain_face', 'sites': 2}, {'step': 'all_top', 'reason': 'unused_chain_face', 'sites': 8}], 'unconsumed_sites': 6}
   formula of r: ('3X（里山），3X（里山）', '')
ordinary stitch heads retired as unused chain face: REJECT  [as expected] :: 未用锁针侧须引用实际起链或锁针桥，不能用来注销普通针目
a whole live row retired as finished_border, plan closes with nothing left: ACCEPT :: created=8 consumed=8 final={}
